---
import epilogo from "../../assets/images/epilogo.jpg";
import epilogoMobile from "../../assets/images/epilogo_mobile.png";
---

<div class="card bg-bgwhite mt-5">
  <section
    class="bg-bgwhite text-bgwhite py-16 px-6 lg:px-8 leading-relaxed text-pretty flex flex-col justify-between items-center h-screen gap-4 text-center relative"
  >
    <picture
      class="w-full h-full object-cover absolute inset-0 card z-0 fusion-a-blanco"
    >
      <source srcset={epilogo.src} media="(min-width: 1024px)" />
      <source srcset={epilogoMobile.src} media="(max-width: 1024px)" />
      <img
        src={epilogo.src}
        alt="First image"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </picture>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#00000050_5%,#000000_100%)] fusion-a-blanco"
    >
    </div> 
    <p class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl max-w-240 pt-4">
      "Nosotros creemos que, cuando Dios las une, dejan de ser dos caminos para
      convertirse en una sola historia.”
    </p>

    <div class="card text-2xl lg:text-3xl">
      <p>Con inmensa gratitud</p>
      <p class="text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-bold italic">
        Brenda <span class="font-serif">&</span> Carlos
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .fusion-a-blanco {
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 2.5%,
      black 10%,
      black 100%
    );
    mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 2.5%,
      black 10%,
      black 100%
    );
  }
</style>
